gs-section-reset :: A Reset button appears on a section's header only while the section differs from its default, and puts the whole section back.
gs-row-context-menu :: Right-click an inspector row for its value in the selected action and its default.
gs-focus-averse-typing :: A field takes the keys only when you click in it or choose a command that opens one for typing, and hands them back when you finish.
gs-multi-line-field-keys :: In a multi-line field, Return applies and a modified Return starts a new line.
gs-modes-esc-leaves :: Esc backs out of a canvas drag, crop mode, region mode, an eyedropper or a selected curve point.
gs-no-change-beep :: An edit that would change nothing beeps but shows no message, because no rule was broken.
gs-what-needs-a-key :: Anything that sends your words or audio to a language or cloud model needs your own key; everything that runs on your Mac needs none.
gs-check-for-updates :: Frame Job ▸ Check for Updates… checks now for a newer Frame Job and offers to install it.
gs-automatic-update-checks :: The second time you open Frame Job it asks whether to check automatically; if you agree it checks about once a day while open.
